    "Open a chosen Bot and start hands-free voice-note recording. Tap Send to transcribe and send, or discard the recording. Works with a saved shortcut assigned to Back Tap or the Action button.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开所选机器人并开始免提录制语音消息。轻点“发送”即可转写并发送，也可丢弃录音。可用于分配到轻点背面或操作按钮的已保存快捷指令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open a chosen Bot's conversation in OpenTeam. Save the Bot in a shortcut to use it with Back Tap or the Action button.": {
