            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 服务商找不到此模型。请选择其他模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI provider didn't accept a request to this model. Choose a different model or reasoning effort.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
