            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 服务商不接受对此模型的请求。请选择其他模型或推理强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI provider didn't accept the sign-in or key. Sign in again, or choose a different AI.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 服务商未接受该登录或密钥。请重新登录，或选择其他 AI。"
          }
