            "value": "你的机器人已创建。打开它打个招呼吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your bots use this provider. They can't reply until you choose another model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的机器人正在使用此服务商，在你选择其他模型之前将无法回复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your bots use this provider. They can't reply until you connect a model again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的机器人使用此服务商。重新连接模型前它们无法回复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your help is needed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要你的帮助"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your password will be sent without HTTPS protection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的密码将在没有 HTTPS 保护的情况下发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your plan or an Anthropic key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的订阅或 Anthropic 密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your plan or an OpenAI key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的订阅或 OpenAI 密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your profile changes haven’t been saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的个人资料更改尚未保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your server already has bots. Open OpenTeam to chat with them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的服务器已有机器人。打开 OpenTeam 与它们聊天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your server and bot computer update together. Files, installed software and browser sign-ins stay in place. Open browser tabs close during the restart.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器和机器人电脑会一起更新。文件、已安装的软件和浏览器登录状态都会保留。重启期间打开的浏览器标签页会关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your server and bot computer will restart briefly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的服务器和机器人电脑会短暂重启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your server couldn't reach the AI right now. Check its internet connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的服务器当前无法连接到 AI。请检查其网络连接后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your server didn't answer in time. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的服务器未能及时响应。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your server is busy right now. Wait a moment and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的服务器当前繁忙。请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your server is restarting. We'll reconnect automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的服务器正在重启。我们会自动重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your server matches iOS app %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的服务器与 iOS 应用 %@ 匹配。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your server's answer didn't come through. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的服务器的回应未能送达。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your sign-in code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的登录验证码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your sign-in is saved. Reconnect to refresh this plugin’s tools.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的登录已保存。重新连接以刷新此插件的工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’ll copy one address back into OpenTeam to finish connecting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你将把一个地址复制回 OpenTeam 以完成连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dismissed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已忽略"
          }
        }
      }
